  KeyGen              50.23 +/-  2.51         113.36 +/-  0.77      2.26x
  Sign               481.75 +/- 64.06         492.67 +/- 29.76      1.02x
  Verify             102.38 +/-  0.50         113.19 +/-  5.10      1.11x
  PreSign            456.92 +/- 17.58         524.59 +/- 24.98      1.15x
